            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-4__item-2">
              <num>29</num>
              <heading>Application</heading>
              <content>
                <p>	Despite the repeals made by this Act of the following provisions of the <i>Corporations (Fees) Act 2001</i>:</p>
              </content>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-4__item-2__para-a">
                <num>a</num>
                <content>
                  <p>	(a)	paragraphs (m) and (n) of the definition of <b><i>chargeable matter</i></b> in subsection 4(1);</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-4__item-2__para-b">
                <num>b</num>
                <content>
                  <p>subsection 6(6);</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-4__item-2__para-c">
                <num>c</num>
                <content>
                  <p><ref href="#sec-6A">section 6A</ref>;</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-4__item-2__para-d">
